{"id":"7b4593604275f471","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-thm-ctm-existence.md","title":"CTM Existence","display":"thm-ctm-existence — CTM Existence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-ctm-existence","aliases":["58-thm-ctm-existence"],"display":"thm-ctm-existence — CTM Existence","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-ctm-existence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-ctm-existence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ctm-existence — CTM Existence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a9132c2c1a18acd1\" href=\"?note=a9132c2c1a18acd1\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,M\\in V\">\\(W,M\\in V\\)</span> (set-sized model parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S,\\mathrm{CTM}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S,\\mathrm{CTM}_S\\)</span> (ZFC transitive-model and countable-transitive-model predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> (the first-order ZFC theory)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ctm\\text{-}existence} \\vdash \\exists W\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(W)\\to\\exists M\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ctm\\text{-}existence} \\vdash \\exists W\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(W)\\to\\exists M\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Externally take a countable elementary submodel of the well-founded structure <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W,\\in)\">\\((W,\\in)\\)</span> and apply the Mostowski collapse.</li>\n<li>The premise uses the registered membership-structure satisfaction predicate through <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S\\)</span>, rather than an unguarded expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(W\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span>. It is much stronger than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC})\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W,M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S,\\mathrm{CTM}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ctm\\text{-}existence} \\vdash \\exists W\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(W)\\to\\exists M\\in V\\;\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC})","display":true},{"tex":"(W,\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"W\\models\\mathrm{ZFC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{ZFC})","display":false}],"bytes":1080,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4105","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-thm-ctm-existence.md|58-thm-ctm-existence]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["66d43bb76d055059","a9132c2c1a18acd1"]}